An internal transfer and a split carry SEK basis without an exchange price.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight transactions --accounts 'Assets:Other' --format text

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
  format 1,000.00 SEK
commodity FUND
  format 1,000 FUND
account Assets:Broker
account Assets:Other
account Assets:Cash

2024-01-01 Purchase
  Assets:Broker  4 FUND {100 SEK}
  Assets:Cash  -400 SEK

2024-01-02 Transfer two units
  Assets:Broker  -2 FUND {{200 SEK}}
  Assets:Other  2 FUND {{200 SEK}}

2024-01-03 Two-for-one split of the transferred units
  Assets:Other  -2 FUND {{200 SEK}}
  Assets:Other  4 FUND {{200 SEK}}

========== OUTPUT ==========

2024-01-02 Transfer two units
    Assets:Broker                       -2 FUND {100.00 SEK}
    Assets:Other                        2 FUND {100.00 SEK}

2024-01-03 Two-for-one split of the transferred units
    Assets:Other                        -2 FUND {100.00 SEK}
    Assets:Other                        4 FUND {50.00 SEK}

========== WARNINGS ==========
